# @GAME_TITLE@

C 3D game generated with miniGameEngine (`@GAME_NAME@`, C-3D template).

## Prerequisites

- CMake 3.25+ and a C99/C++17 compiler (GCC 11+, Clang 14+, or MSVC 2022).
- Linux dependencies (Ubuntu 24.04):
  ```bash
  sudo apt install -y cmake ninja-build libglm-dev libasound2-dev libpulse-dev libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers glslang-tools
  ```

## Building and Running

Using `mge` CLI:

```bash
mge build
mge run
mge test
```

Or directly with CMake:

```bash
cmake --preset dev
cmake --build --preset dev
ctest --preset dev
```
